#: conf.json:summary
msgid "Local ranking and search toolkit for MoonBit packages, combining dependency, release, and download signals."
msgstr "面向 MoonBit 包的本地排名与搜索工具集，综合依赖、发布和下载信号。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:1
msgid "cli API"
msgstr "cli API"

#: manual/api/cli.md:3
#: manual/api/score.md:3
#: manual/api/static_search.md:3
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: manual/api/cli.md:5
msgid "The package `Luna-Flow/mooncake-impact-factor/cli` is an executable for the JavaScript target. It reads the eight signals of a score snapshot from a JSON file, calls [`compute_score_snapshot`](score.md#compute_score_snapshot) and prints the result as JSON. It exists so that programs outside MoonBit, above all the Python index builder, use the MoonBit score rules instead of copying them."
msgstr "包 `Luna-Flow/mooncake-impact-factor/cli` 是面向 JavaScript 目标的可执行程序。它从 JSON 文件读取分数快照的八个信号，调用 [`compute_score_snapshot`](score.md#compute_score_snapshot)，并以 JSON 输出结果。它的存在是为了让 MoonBit 之外的程序（首先是 Python 索引构建器）直接使用 MoonBit 的评分规则，而不是复制一份。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:12
msgid "Source: [`src/cli/main.mbt`](../../../src/cli/main.mbt). Its interface file is empty: the package exports no MoonBit names, and its interface is the command line described here."
msgstr "源码：[`src/cli/main.mbt`](../../../src/cli/main.mbt)。它的接口文件为空：该包不导出任何 MoonBit 名称，其接口就是本页描述的命令行。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:16
msgid "Building"
msgstr "构建"

#: manual/api/cli.md:18
msgid "The package cannot be imported: it is an executable with no exported names. It declares `supported_targets = \"js\"` and `pkgtype(kind: \"executable\")`. Build it from the repository root:"
msgstr "该包无法被导入：它是一个没有导出名称的可执行包。它声明了 `supported_targets = \"js\"` 和 `pkgtype(kind: \"executable\")`。在仓库根目录下构建："

#: manual/api/cli.md:26
msgid "The index builder expects the result at `_build/js/debug/build/cli/cli.js` and builds it when the file is missing. The script needs a Node.js version with `process.getBuiltinModule` (20.16, 22.3 or later)."
msgstr "索引构建器期望构建结果位于 `_build/js/debug/build/cli/cli.js`，文件不存在时会自动构建。该脚本需要支持 `process.getBuiltinModule` 的 Node.js 版本（20.16、22.3 或更高）。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:33
msgid "`score-snapshot` computes one score snapshot from a JSON input file."
msgstr "`score-snapshot` 根据一个 JSON 输入文件计算一个分数快照。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:39
msgid "The first argument after the script must be `score-snapshot`. `--input` may appear anywhere after it; the first `--input` that is followed by a value wins, and other arguments are ignored."
msgstr "脚本之后的第一个参数必须是 `score-snapshot`。`--input` 可以出现在其后的任意位置；以第一个后面跟有值的 `--input` 为准，其他参数会被忽略。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:43
msgid "Input"
msgstr "输入"

#: manual/api/cli.md:45
msgid "The file must contain one JSON object. Each key is optional:"
msgstr "文件必须包含一个 JSON 对象。每个键都是可选的："

#: manual/api/cli.md:47
#: manual/design/static_search.md:43
msgid "Key"
msgstr "键"

#: manual/api/cli.md:47
#: manual/architecture.md:44
msgid "Signal"
msgstr "信号"

#: manual/api/cli.md:49
msgid "Current dependents."
msgstr "当前的依赖方数量。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:50
msgid "Current recent dependents."
msgstr "当前的近期依赖方数量。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:51
msgid "Current downloads."
msgstr "当前的下载量。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:52
msgid "Days since the latest release, now."
msgstr "当前距最新发布的天数。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:53
msgid "Dependents 30 days ago."
msgstr "30 天前的依赖方数量。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:54
msgid "Recent dependents 30 days ago."
msgstr "30 天前的近期依赖方数量。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:55
msgid "Downloads 30 days ago."
msgstr "30 天前的下载量。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:56
msgid "Days since the latest release, 30 days ago."
msgstr "30 天前距最新发布的天数。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:58
msgid "A value is used when it is a JSON number; it is converted to `Int` by truncation toward zero (`12.9` becomes `12`), and values beyond the `Int` range saturate at its bounds. A missing key, a value of any other JSON type (including a numeric string such as `\"20\"`) and a top-level value that is not an object all count as `0`. The score functions then clamp negative values to `0`. Unknown keys are ignored."
msgstr "值为 JSON 数字时才会被采用：它通过向零截断转换为 `Int`（`12.9` 变为 `12`），超出 `Int` 范围的值会饱和到其边界。缺失的键、其他任何 JSON 类型的值（包括 `\"20\"` 这样的数字字符串）以及顶层不是对象的值都按 `0` 处理。随后评分函数会把负值截为 `0`。未知的键会被忽略。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:78
#: manual/api/cli.md:95
msgid "Output"
msgstr "输出"

#: manual/api/cli.md:80
msgid "On success the command prints one line, the JSON form of the [`ScoreSnapshot`](score.md#scoresnapshot), and exits with status `0`. Fields appear in declaration order. A `NaN` field, which only arises from a count of `2147483647` or more, is written as the string `\"NaN\"`. For the input above the output is:"
msgstr "成功时，命令输出一行内容，即 [`ScoreSnapshot`](score.md#scoresnapshot) 的 JSON 形式，并以状态 `0` 退出。字段按声明顺序排列。值为 `NaN` 的字段（只会由 `2147483647` 或更大的计数产生）会写成字符串 `\"NaN\"`。对于上面的输入，输出为："

#: manual/api/cli.md:90
msgid "Errors"
msgstr "错误"

#: manual/api/cli.md:92
msgid "Usage and parse errors print one JSON object with an `error` key to standard output and exit with status `1`:"
msgstr "用法错误和解析错误会向标准输出打印一个带 `error` 键的 JSON 对象，并以状态 `1` 退出："

#: manual/api/cli.md:95
msgid "Situation"
msgstr "情形"

#: manual/api/cli.md:97
msgid "No arguments, or the first argument is not `score-snapshot`"
msgstr "没有参数，或第一个参数不是 `score-snapshot`"

#: manual/api/cli.md:98
msgid "No `--input` followed by a value"
msgstr "没有后面跟有值的 `--input`"

#: manual/api/cli.md:99
msgid "The file is not valid JSON"
msgstr "文件不是合法的 JSON"

#: manual/api/cli.md:101
msgid "A file that cannot be read is not reported this way: Node.js raises an uncaught `ENOENT` (or similar) error, prints a stack trace to standard error and exits with status `1`. Callers should treat any non-zero status as a failure and parse standard output only on status `0`."
msgstr "无法读取的文件不会以这种方式报告：Node.js 会抛出未捕获的 `ENOENT`（或类似）错误，向标准错误打印堆栈跟踪，并以状态 `1` 退出。调用方应把任何非零状态视为失败，并且只在状态为 `0` 时解析标准输出。"

#: manual/api/score.md:1
msgid "score API"
msgstr "score API"

#: manual/api/score.md:5
msgid "The package `Luna-Flow/mooncake-impact-factor/score` computes the impact score of a MoonBit package from four integer signals, labels the score with a rank and a momentum class, and bundles everything into a `ScoreSnapshot`. Every function is pure and total: it never aborts and has no hidden state."
msgstr "包 `Luna-Flow/mooncake-impact-factor/score` 根据四个整数信号计算 MoonBit 包的影响力分数，为分数加上等级和势头类别标签，并把所有结果打包成一个 `ScoreSnapshot`。每个函数都是纯函数且是全函数：从不中止，也没有隐藏状态。"

#: manual/api/score.md:10
msgid "Source: [`src/score/impact_factor.mbt`](../../../src/score/impact_factor.mbt). The mathematics behind the formula is in the [score design](../design/score.md)."
msgstr "源码：[`src/score/impact_factor.mbt`](../../../src/score/impact_factor.mbt)。公式背后的数学见 [score 设计](../design/score.md)。"

#: manual/api/score.md:13
#: manual/api/static_search.md:15
msgid "Importing"
msgstr "导入"

#: manual/api/score.md:15
msgid "Add the package to your `moon.pkg`. The examples on this page call it as `@score`; the JSON examples also import `moonbitlang/core/json`."
msgstr "在你的 `moon.pkg` 中加入本包。本页示例以 `@score` 调用它；JSON 相关示例还导入了 `moonbitlang/core/json`。"

#: manual/api/score.md:24
msgid "Signals"
msgstr "信号"

#: manual/api/score.md:26
msgid "Every scoring function takes the same four signals, in this order:"
msgstr "每个评分函数都按以下顺序接收同样的四个信号："

#: manual/api/score.md:28
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "参数"

#: manual/api/score.md:28
#: manual/api/score.md:196
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: manual/api/score.md:30
msgid "Number of packages that depend on this package."
msgstr "依赖本包的包的数量。"

#: manual/api/score.md:31
msgid "Number of those dependents that first appeared in the recent window."
msgstr "这些依赖方中首次出现在近期窗口内的数量。"

#: manual/api/score.md:32
msgid "Download count, or `0` when unknown."
msgstr "下载次数，未知时为 `0`。"

#: manual/api/score.md:33
msgid "Whole days since the latest release."
msgstr "距最新发布的整天数。"

#: manual/api/score.md:35
msgid "The functions do not check that the signals are consistent, for example that `recent_dependents <= dependents`. Negative values are clamped to `0`. The index builder fills the signals from a local registry snapshot; see the [architecture guide](../architecture.md)."
msgstr "这些函数不检查信号之间是否一致，例如是否满足 `recent_dependents <= dependents`。负值会被截为 `0`。索引构建器根据本地注册表快照填写这些信号；参见[架构指南](../architecture.md)。"

#: manual/api/score.md:40
msgid "Scores"
msgstr "分数"

#: manual/api/score.md:44
msgid "`compute_score` returns the impact score of a package."
msgstr "`compute_score` 返回一个包的影响力分数。"

#: manual/api/score.md:50
msgid "With $\\sigma(n) = \\ln(1 + \\max(n, 0))$, $D$ dependents, $R$ recent dependents, $W$ downloads and $t$ days since release, the result is"
msgstr "设 $\\sigma(n) = \\ln(1 + \\max(n, 0))$，$D$ 为依赖方数量，$R$ 为近期依赖方数量，$W$ 为下载量，$t$ 为距发布的天数，则结果为"

#: manual/api/score.md:57
msgid "where $m(t)$ is `activity_multiplier(t)`. The score is $0$ exactly when all three counts are $0$ or negative, and it never decreases when a count grows. It has no upper limit by design, but for counts below $2^{31} - 1$ it stays below about $2094$."
msgstr "其中 $m(t)$ 是 `activity_multiplier(t)`。当且仅当三个计数都为 $0$ 或负数时分数为 $0$，并且任何计数增大时分数都不会减小。按设计分数没有上限，但当计数小于 $2^{31} - 1$ 时，分数始终低于约 $2094$。"

#: manual/api/score.md:62
msgid "[!WARNING] A count equal to `2147483647` (the largest `Int`) overflows when $1$ is added, and the score becomes `NaN`. Real registry counts are far below this."
msgstr "[!WARNING] 等于 `2147483647`（最大的 `Int`）的计数在加 $1$ 时会溢出，分数变为 `NaN`。真实注册表中的计数远低于这个值。"

#: manual/api/score.md:76
msgid "`activity_multiplier` returns the release-recency factor $m(t)$ applied to the whole score."
msgstr "`activity_multiplier` 返回作用于整个分数的发布时效因子 $m(t)$。"

#: manual/api/score.md:83
msgid "A negative `days_since_release` counts as `0`."
msgstr "负的 `days_since_release` 按 `0` 处理。"

#: manual/api/score.md:85
msgid "Days since release"
msgstr "距发布的天数"

#: manual/api/score.md:85
msgid "Multiplier"
msgstr "乘数"

#: manual/api/score.md:87
msgid "`0` to `30`"
msgstr "`0` 到 `30`"

#: manual/api/score.md:88
msgid "`31` to `90`"
msgstr "`31` 到 `90`"

#: manual/api/score.md:89
msgid "`91` to `180`"
msgstr "`91` 到 `180`"

#: manual/api/score.md:90
msgid "`181` to `365`"
msgstr "`181` 到 `365`"

#: manual/api/score.md:91
msgid "`366` or more"
msgstr "`366` 或更多"

#: manual/api/score.md:103
msgid "`clamp_non_negative` returns `value` when it is non-negative and `0` otherwise."
msgstr "`clamp_non_negative` 在 `value` 非负时返回 `value`，否则返回 `0`。"

#: manual/api/score.md:110
msgid "The scoring functions apply it to every signal. It is public so that callers can prepare signals the same way."
msgstr "评分函数会对每个信号应用它。它是公开的，以便调用方用同样的方式准备信号。"

#: manual/api/score.md:120
msgid "Labels"
msgstr "标签"

#: manual/api/score.md:124
msgid "`rank_label` maps a score to one of the rank buckets `S`, `A`, `B`, `C` and `D`."
msgstr "`rank_label` 把分数映射到等级桶 `S`、`A`、`B`、`C`、`D` 之一。"

#: manual/api/score.md:131
msgid "Rank"
msgstr "等级"

#: manual/api/score.md:131
#: manual/api/score.md:160
msgid "Condition"
msgstr "条件"

#: manual/api/score.md:137
msgid "`score < 50.0`, or `score` is `NaN`"
msgstr "`score < 50.0`，或 `score` 为 `NaN`"

#: manual/api/score.md:149
msgid "`compute_momentum_label` classifies how fast a score grew as `Rising`, `Hot` or `Stable`."
msgstr "`compute_momentum_label` 把分数增长的快慢分类为 `Rising`、`Hot` 或 `Stable`。"

#: manual/api/score.md:156
msgid "The arguments are the current score $S$, the score 30 days ago $S_{30}$, the growth ratio $r$ and the number of recent dependents $R$. With the growth $G = S - S_{30}$:"
msgstr "参数依次为当前分数 $S$、30 天前的分数 $S_{30}$、增长率 $r$ 和近期依赖方数量 $R$。设增长量 $G = S - S_{30}$："

#: manual/api/score.md:160
msgid "Label"
msgstr "标签"

#: manual/api/score.md:162
msgid "$G \\ge 35$ and $r \\ge 0.35$ and $R \\ge 3$"
msgstr "$G \\ge 35$ 且 $r \\ge 0.35$ 且 $R \\ge 3$"

#: manual/api/score.md:163
msgid "not `Rising`, and $G \\ge 18$ and $r \\ge 0.18$ and $R \\ge 2$"
msgstr "不是 `Rising`，且 $G \\ge 18$、$r \\ge 0.18$、$R \\ge 2$"

#: manual/api/score.md:164
msgid "otherwise, including any `NaN` argument"
msgstr "其他情况，包括任一参数为 `NaN`"

#: manual/api/score.md:166
msgid "The function does not check that `growth_ratio` matches the two scores; `compute_score_snapshot` computes it for you."
msgstr "该函数不检查 `growth_ratio` 是否与两个分数相符；`compute_score_snapshot` 会替你计算它。"

#: manual/api/score.md:177
msgid "Snapshots"
msgstr "快照"

#: manual/api/score.md:181
msgid "`ScoreSnapshot` is the full result of scoring one package at one point in time."
msgstr "`ScoreSnapshot` 是对一个包在某一时间点评分的完整结果。"

#: manual/api/score.md:196
msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

#: manual/api/score.md:198
msgid "The current score $S$."
msgstr "当前分数 $S$。"

#: manual/api/score.md:199
msgid "The score $S_{30}$ computed from the historical signals."
msgstr "由历史信号计算出的分数 $S_{30}$。"

#: manual/api/score.md:200
msgid "$G = S - S_{30}$; negative when the score fell."
msgstr "$G = S - S_{30}$；分数下降时为负。"

#: manual/api/score.md:201
msgid "$G / S_{30}$ when $S_{30} > 0$; otherwise $1$ when $G > 0$ and $0$ when $G \\le 0$."
msgstr "当 $S_{30} > 0$ 时为 $G / S_{30}$；否则 $G > 0$ 时为 $1$，$G \\le 0$ 时为 $0$。"

#: manual/api/score.md:204
msgid "`activity_multiplier(days_since_release)` for the current signals."
msgstr "当前信号对应的 `activity_multiplier(days_since_release)`。"

#: manual/api/score.md:206
msgid "The fields are read-only outside the package; build a snapshot with `compute_score_snapshot`. `ToJson` writes an object whose keys are the field names, which is the output format of the [`cli` command](cli.md). `FromJson` reads the same format back and raises `@json.JsonDecodeError` when a field is missing or has the wrong type. `Debug` supports `debug_inspect` and `Repr(...)`. The struct does not implement `Eq`; compare snapshots through their fields or their JSON form."
msgstr "这些字段在包外是只读的；请用 `compute_score_snapshot` 构造快照。`ToJson` 写出一个以字段名为键的对象，这正是 [`cli` 命令](cli.md)的输出格式。`FromJson` 读回同样的格式，字段缺失或类型错误时抛出 `@json.JsonDecodeError`。`Debug` 支持 `debug_inspect` 和 `Repr(...)`。该结构体没有实现 `Eq`；请通过字段或 JSON 形式比较快照。"

#: manual/api/score.md:226
msgid "`compute_score_snapshot` scores a package now and 30 days ago, and derives the growth, both labels and the multiplier in one call."
msgstr "`compute_score_snapshot` 对一个包分别计算当前和 30 天前的分数，并在一次调用中得出增长量、两个标签和乘数。"

#: manual/api/score.md:233
msgid "The first four arguments are the current signals, the last four the signals as they were 30 days ago, both in the order of the [signals table](#signals):"
msgstr "前四个参数是当前信号，后四个是 30 天前的信号，二者都按[信号表](#signals)的顺序排列："

#: manual/api/score.md:244
msgid "The momentum label uses the current `recent_dependents`. A package that did not exist 30 days ago is described by historical signals of `0`; its `score_30d_ago` is then $0$ and its growth ratio is $1$."
msgstr "势头标签使用当前的 `recent_dependents`。30 天前尚不存在的包，其历史信号都为 `0`；此时它的 `score_30d_ago` 为 $0$，增长率为 $1$。"

#: manual/api/score.md:268
#: manual/api/score.md:274
msgid "Deprecated"
msgstr "已弃用"

#: manual/api/score.md:270
msgid "`ScoreSnapshot` still has three methods that earlier MoonBit versions created implicitly from its derived traits. They are hidden from the interface file and warn when used."
msgstr "`ScoreSnapshot` 仍保留三个方法，它们是早期 MoonBit 版本根据其派生 trait 隐式生成的。这些方法已从接口文件中隐藏，使用时会产生警告。"

#: manual/api/score.md:274
msgid "Use instead"
msgstr "替代方案"

#: manual/api/score.md:278
msgid "`Repr(s)`, `debug_inspect` or `@debug.to_string`"
msgstr "`Repr(s)`、`debug_inspect` 或 `@debug.to_string`"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:1
msgid "static_search API"
msgstr "static_search API"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:5
msgid "The package `Luna-Flow/mooncake-impact-factor/static_search` holds the MoonBit side of the static publishing mode: a version tag for the static search runtime and the text normalisation used to make search case-insensitive. It builds only for the JavaScript target and is also linked as an ES module that JavaScript code can import."
msgstr "包 `Luna-Flow/mooncake-impact-factor/static_search` 承载静态发布模式中的 MoonBit 部分：静态搜索运行时的版本标记，以及使搜索不区分大小写的文本规范化。它只为 JavaScript 目标构建，同时还会被链接为一个可供 JavaScript 代码导入的 ES 模块。"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:11
msgid "Source: [`src/static_search/search.mbt`](../../../src/static_search/search.mbt). The search index and the query algorithm that run in the browser are described in the [static_search design](../design/static_search.md)."
msgstr "源码：[`src/static_search/search.mbt`](../../../src/static_search/search.mbt)。在浏览器中运行的搜索索引和查询算法见 [static_search 设计](../design/static_search.md)。"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:17
msgid "Add the package to your `moon.pkg`; the importing package must build for the JavaScript target as well, and its tests run with `moon test --target js`:"
msgstr "在你的 `moon.pkg` 中加入本包；导入它的包也必须为 JavaScript 目标构建，其测试用 `moon test --target js` 运行："

#: manual/api/static_search.md:30
msgid "`runtime_version` returns the version tag of the static search runtime."
msgstr "`runtime_version` 返回静态搜索运行时的版本标记。"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:36
msgid "The current tag is `\"static-search-js-v1\"`. JavaScript code that loads the compiled module can read it to tell which runtime it got."
msgstr "当前标记为 `\"static-search-js-v1\"`。加载编译后模块的 JavaScript 代码可以读取它来判断拿到的是哪个运行时。"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:47
msgid "`normalize_text` returns `input` converted to lower case."
msgstr "`normalize_text` 返回转换为小写的 `input`。"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:53
msgid "The conversion is JavaScript's `String.prototype.toLowerCase`: the Unicode default lower-case mapping, independent of the user's locale. It may change the length of the string (`\"İ\"` becomes `\"i̇\"`, two UTF-16 code units). It does not trim or collapse white space and does not remove accents."
msgstr "转换使用 JavaScript 的 `String.prototype.toLowerCase`：Unicode 默认小写映射，与用户的区域设置无关。它可能改变字符串长度（`\"İ\"` 变为 `\"i̇\"`，即两个 UTF-16 码元）。它不会去除或合并空白，也不会移除重音符号。"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:65
msgid "JavaScript module"
msgstr "JavaScript 模块"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:67
msgid "`moon build src/static_search --target js` also writes an ES module, because the package's `moon.pkg` links it with"
msgstr "`moon build src/static_search --target js` 还会写出一个 ES 模块，因为该包的 `moon.pkg` 用以下配置链接它"

#: manual/api/static_search.md:81
