msgstr "快速上手"

#: manual/getting_started.md:3
msgid "This guide takes you from a fresh checkout to a running web application with your own rankings, and shows how to query its HTTP API. It describes version `0.1.2`. The [architecture guide](architecture.md) explains what each step does."
msgstr "本指南带你从全新的检出开始，运行起带有你自己排名的 Web 应用，并演示如何查询它的 HTTP API。本指南描述的是 `0.1.2` 版本。[架构指南](architecture.md)解释了每一步的作用。"

