msgstr "`~/.moon/registry/index/user` 下的本地 MoonBit 注册表快照；`moon update` 会创建或刷新它"

#: manual/getting_started.md:16
msgid "1. Build the database"
msgstr "1. 构建数据库"

#: manual/getting_started.md:18
msgid "Build the `cli` command that scores packages, then the database, with live mooncakes download lookup enabled:"
msgstr "先构建为包评分的 `cli` 命令，再在启用 mooncakes 实时下载量查询的情况下构建数据库："

