msgstr "在未禁用时从 mooncakes 拉取缺失的下载量"

#: manual/getting_started.md:32
msgid "computes package edges, reverse-dependent counts, score snapshots (through the MoonBit `cli` command), and the FTS index"
msgstr "计算包之间的边、反向依赖计数、分数快照（通过 MoonBit `cli` 命令）以及 FTS 索引"

#: manual/getting_started.md:35
msgid "Build without live mooncakes requests:"
msgstr "不访问 mooncakes、离线构建："

#: manual/getting_started.md:41
msgid "Apply a local download override file:"
msgstr "叠加本地下载量覆盖文件："

#: manual/getting_started.md:49
msgid "The override file must be a JSON object keyed by full package name:"
msgstr "覆盖文件必须是一个以完整包名为键的 JSON 对象："

#: manual/getting_started.md:57
msgid "2. Run the local app"
msgstr "2. 运行本地应用"

#: manual/getting_started.md:59
msgid "Install dependencies:"
msgstr "先安装依赖："

#: manual/getting_started.md:65
msgid "Run the full-stack Next.js app:"
msgstr "启动 Next.js 全栈应用："

#: manual/getting_started.md:71
