msgstr "当前应用提供："

#: manual/getting_started.md:75
msgid "`/`: ranked package browsing UI"
msgstr "`/`：包榜单浏览界面"

#: manual/getting_started.md:76
msgid "`/search`: main search results page"
msgstr "`/search`：主搜索结果页"

#: manual/getting_started.md:77
