msgstr "进阶"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:137
msgid "**Batch work.** Each call starts a Node.js process, which costs far more than the score itself. For many packages in one MoonBit program, call `@score.compute_score_snapshot` directly, as in the [score tutorial](score.md)."
msgstr "**批量处理。** 每次调用都会启动一个 Node.js 进程，其开销远大于计算分数本身。在一个 MoonBit 程序中处理大量包时，请像 [score 教程](score.md)那样直接调用 `@score.compute_score_snapshot`。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:141
msgid "**Where the signals come from.** The [architecture guide](../architecture.md) explains how the index builder counts dependents, recent dependents and historical values before it calls this command."
msgstr "**信号从哪里来。** [架构指南](../architecture.md)解释了索引构建器在调用此命令之前如何统计依赖方、近期依赖方和历史值。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:145
msgid "**Strict inputs.** The command accepts sloppy input: strings and `null` become `0`, fractions are truncated. Validate the payload in the caller if a silent `0` would hide a bug."
msgstr "**严格的输入。** 该命令接受不规范的输入：字符串和 `null` 变为 `0`，小数被截断。如果一个悄无声息的 `0` 会掩盖 bug，请在调用方验证负载。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:149
#: manual/tutorial/score.md:222
#: manual/tutorial/static_search.md:178
msgid "Common pitfalls"
msgstr "常见陷阱"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:151
msgid "**Numbers as strings.** `{\"dependents\": \"20\"}` scores as zero dependents. Write `20`, not `\"20\"`."
msgstr "**数字写成字符串。** `{\"dependents\": \"20\"}` 会按零个依赖方评分。请写 `20`，而不是 `\"20\"`。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:153
msgid "**Wrong argument order.** `score-snapshot` must be the first argument after the script; `--input file.json score-snapshot` prints the usage error."
msgstr "**参数顺序错误。** `score-snapshot` 必须是脚本之后的第一个参数；`--input file.json score-snapshot` 会输出用法错误。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:155
msgid "**Stale build.** The index builder reuses an existing `cli.js`. Rebuild after you change `src/score`, or the database is scored with the old rules."
msgstr "**构建过期。** 索引构建器会复用已有的 `cli.js`。修改 `src/score` 后请重新构建，否则数据库会按旧规则评分。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli.md:157
msgid "**Large counts.** A count of `2147483647`, or any larger number (the conversion saturates at the largest `Int`), makes the score `NaN`. JSON has no `NaN`, so the output then contains the string `\"NaN\"` where a number is expected: `{\"score\":\"NaN\",...}`."
msgstr "**过大的计数。** `2147483647` 或任何更大的数（转换会饱和到最大的 `Int`）会使分数变为 `NaN`。JSON 没有 `NaN`，因此输出中本应是数字的位置会出现字符串 `\"NaN\"`：`{\"score\":\"NaN\",...}`。"

